      "updated_at": "2018-06-04T22:51:54Z",
      "body": "> I've found it frustrating when workshop pages are deleted and disappear.\r\n\r\nI know how frustrating this is but there is no way for us to enforce the pages to keep live. And with the new GDPR right to erasure/right to be forgotten it will be harder.\r\n\r\n> Can we include in the template workflow an option/instructions on how to save your site with Internet Archive http://archive.org/web/?\r\n\r\nPull request are welcome but I don't think that a lot of people will use it.",
